---
const pageTitle = "Terms & Conditions | Gokuruvi Tools";
const description =
  "Read the Terms and Conditions for using Gokuruvi Tools.";
const lastUpdated = "30 July 2026";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />

  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
  />

  <title>{pageTitle}</title>

  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />

  <link
    rel="canonical"
    href="https://www.gokuruvi.com/terms"
  />

  <style>
    :root{
      --primary:#2563eb;
      --dark:#0f172a;
      --text:#334155;
      --border:#e2e8f0;
      --bg:#f8fafc;
      --card:#fff;
    }

    *{
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }

    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;
      background:var(--bg);
      color:var(--text);
      line-height:1.8;
    }

    header{
      background:var(--dark);
      padding:18px;
      text-align:center;
    }

    header a{
      color:white;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-size:24px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .hero{
      text-align:center;
      padding:60px 20px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#ffffff);
    }

    .hero h1{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--dark);
      font-size:48px;
    }

    .hero p{
      color:#64748b;
      max-width:650px;
      margin:15px auto;
    }

    .updated{
      display:inline-block;
      margin-top:15px;
      padding:8px 16px;
      border-radius:30px;
      background:#dbeafe;
      color:#1e40af;
      font-weight:600;
      font-size:14px;
    }

    .container{
      max-width:900px;
      margin:40px auto;
      padding:40px;
      background:var(--card);
      border-radius:15px;
      box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    h2{
      color:var(--dark);
      margin-top:35px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom:8px;
    }

    ul{
      padding-left:22px;
    }

    .notice{
      background:#eff6ff;
      border-left:5px solid var(--primary);
      padding:18px;
      border-radius:8px;
      margin-bottom:30px;
    }

    .buttons{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      margin-top:40px;
    }

    .btn{
      text-decoration:none;
      padding:12px 22px;
      border-radius:8px;
      font-weight:600;
    }

    .primary{
      background:var(--primary);
      color:white;
    }

    .secondary{
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      color:var(--dark);
      background:white;
    }

    footer{
      text-align:center;
      padding:30px;
      color:#64748b;
      font-size:14px;
    }

    footer a{
      color:var(--primary);
      text-decoration:none;
    }

    @media(max-width:768px){

      .container{
        margin:20px;
        padding:25px;
      }

      .hero h1{
        font-size:36px;
      }

    }

  </style>

</head>

<body>

<header>
  <a href="/">Gokuruvi Tools</a>
</header>

<section class="hero">

<h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>

<p>
Please read these Terms & Conditions carefully before using
Gokuruvi Tools.
</p>

<div class="updated">
Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
</div>

</section>

<main class="container">

<div class="notice">
Using this website means you agree to these Terms & Conditions.
If you do not agree, please discontinue using the website.
</div>

<h2>1. Website Purpose</h2>

<p>
Gokuruvi Tools provides free online calculators, generators,
validators, and educational resources for Linux, DevOps,
Cloud, Kubernetes, Networking, and IT professionals.
</p>

<h2>2. Acceptable Use</h2>

<ul>
<li>Use the website only for lawful purposes.</li>
<li>Do not damage or disrupt the website.</li>
<li>Do not misuse any online tool.</li>
<li>Comply with all applicable laws.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Generated Content</h2>

<p>
Commands, scripts, templates, and generated content are
provided for educational and productivity purposes.
</p>

<p>
Always review and test generated output before using it in
production environments.
</p>

<h2>4. No Professional Advice</h2>

<p>
Content on this website is provided for general information
only and should not be considered professional, legal,
financial, or security advice.
</p>

<h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>

<p>
Unless otherwise stated, all content, branding, source code,
graphics, and documentation belong to Gokuruvi Tools.
</p>

<h2>6. Third-Party Links</h2>

<p>
This website may link to third-party websites. We are not
responsible for their content, privacy practices, or
availability.
</p>

<h2>7. Disclaimer</h2>

<p>
All tools and information are provided on an
<strong>"AS IS"</strong> and
<strong>"AS AVAILABLE"</strong> basis without warranties.
</p>

<h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>

<p>
Gokuruvi Tools shall not be liable for any loss or damage
resulting from the use of this website or any generated
content.
</p>

<h2>9. Privacy</h2>

<p>
Please review our
<a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
to understand how information may be handled.
</p>

<h2>10. Changes</h2>

<p>
These Terms & Conditions may be updated at any time.
Changes will be published on this page with an updated date.
</p>

<h2>11. Contact</h2>

<p>
For any questions regarding these Terms & Conditions,
please visit our
<a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<a class="btn primary" href="/">
← Return Home
</a>

<a class="btn secondary" href="/privacy-policy">
Privacy Policy
</a>

</div>

</main>

<footer>

© {new Date().getFullYear()} Gokuruvi Tools. All Rights Reserved.

</footer>

</body>
</html>